 k, Up          | Previous entry
 h, Left        | Go to the parent directory
 l, Right       | Open the hovered dir or file (an archive asks what to do, see ARCHIVES)
 Enter          | Same as l; in picker mode, picks the hovered file
 PgDn, ^D       | Page down (^D: half page)
 PgUp, ^U       | Page up (^U: half page)
