_______________ + _______________________________________________________
.Ed
.Ss Filter & Prompt
.Bd -literal

 Key | Function
____ + _________________________________________________________
 /   | Filter entries in the current directory
 ^N  | Toggle type-to-nav mode
 ^L  | Clear or apply the filter (type-to-nav and filter prompt)
____ + _________________________________________________________
.Ed
.Pp
\fBOpen with\fR (\fBo\fR, \fB^O\fR) asks for a command at the \fBopen with:\fR prompt. Type it and press Enter,
for example \fBvlc\fR, \fBopen -a Preview\fR or \fBcode\fR. nnn adds the path of the hovered entry as the last
argument. The command is run directly, not through a shell, so shell aliases, functions and pipes
do not work (use a program name or a script on your PATH); an unknown command shows
\fBcommand not found\fR, and a GUI launch shows a \fBlaunched\fR notice. A GUI app gets no terminal, input or output. A second prompt asks how to run it:
.Bd -literal
 Key       | Runs the command
__________ + ____________________________________________________________________
 g, Enter  | Graphical app (open, vlc): detached, output discarded, nnn keeps running
 c         | Terminal app (nvim, less): runs in the terminal, nnn waits for it
 any other | Cancel
__________ + ____________________________________________________________________
.Ed
.Pp
These keys work in every text prompt (new, rename, open with, ...):
.Bd -literal
 Key            | Function
_______________ + _______________________________________________________
 Enter          | Accept
 Esc            | Cancel
 ^A, ^E         | Start, end of line
 ^F, ^B         | Forward, back one character
 ^W, ^U, ^K, ^L | Delete word before cursor, before cursor, after cursor,
                | whole line
 ^D             | Delete character (cancels on an empty prompt)
 Tab            | Insert hovered file names, cycling on repeat
 ^g             | Paste the first entry copied with C or ^B
_______________ + _______________________________________________________
.Ed
.Ss Display
.Bd -literal

 Key | Function
____ + ________________________________________________________________
