 M   | Toggle octal permissions in detail mode
 y   | Cycle the detail time format: ISO, eza, US, eza with weekday for
     | files modified today
 I   | Toggle directory sizes in detail mode
____ + ________________________________________________________________
.Ed
.Ss Files
.Bd -literal

 Key      | Function
_________ + ____________________________________________________________
