.Ed
.Pp
C and ^B put one name or path per line on the clipboard. In any text prompt,
such as the one opened by \fBn\fR, \fB^g\fR (lowercase) inserts the first
copied entry at the cursor. If several entries were copied, only the first
is inserted.
.Ss Misc
.Bd -literal

 Key    | Function
_______ + ___________________________________________
 ;      | Run a plugin by its key; ;; is Quick Look
 Alt+;  | Select a plugin from a menu
 =      | Launch a GUI application
 ! , ^] | Spawn a shell in the current directory
 ]      | Command prompt
 c      | Connect to a remote host over SSHFS
 u      | Unmount a remote host or archive
 t, ^T  | Sort toggles (see SORTING)
 T      | Set the time type: access, change, modified
 s      | Manage sessions
